#. type: Content of: <chapter><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/prog/prog.xml:14
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"A base LFS system can be used as a development platform, however the base "
"system only includes language support for <application>C</application>, "
"<application>C++</application>, <application>Perl</application>, and "
"<application>Python</application>.  This chapter provides instructions to "
"build many popular programming environments to greatly expand your system's "
"development capabilities."
msgstr ""
